Z||000000||CozmoPooky||12-17-2000||10:04 AM||||Here's a site that does stuff to a 4.9 caddy <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/stars/mycaddy/asg.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/stars/mycaddy/asg.htm</A> <BR>Looks like a lot of cool info for anyone considering this engine for a swap... <P>------------------<BR>CozmoPooky<BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>'87 Duke Coupe<BR>'85 2M6 Targa||||reg||1
